This chapter follows the family of Karin Solberg, Tamsin's mother. Her father, Arne Solberg, grew up in Minneapolis in a Norwegian-American family. Her mother, Ruth Kessler, grew up in Madison, the daughter of Herman Kessler and Anna Vogel.

Nearly everything known about these families comes from Ruth's own memories, recorded by Tamsin in 2023. The chapter says where each detail comes from.
